        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "In Utah, an asphalt shingle roof replacement typically costs between $7,000 and $15,000 (averaging around $11,715) with a lifespan of 15 to 30 years. By comparison, a metal roof costs $18,000 to $40,000+ upfront\u2014roughly two to three times more\u2014but lasts 40 to 70+ years.",
